<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala sets dividend on preferred shares.</title>
<headline>Ayala sets dividend on preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine conglomerate Ayala Corp said on Tuesday it would pay its second quarterly 1.25 centavo cash dividend for its preferred convertible B shares on October 30.</p>
<p>The record date for the dividend is set on October 22.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
